Build, deploy, and scale AI-powered applications with confidence\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sophia.agencyos.network\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Sophia AI Factory\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sophia.agencyos.network/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Sophia AI Factory\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Sophia AI Factory\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Build, deploy, and scale AI-powered applications with confidence\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sophia.agencyos.network/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Create New Proposal</h1><p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-1\">Generate a professional proposal using AI in under 30 seconds</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Proposal Details</h2><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div><label for=\"templateId\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Proposal Template</label><select id=\"templateId\" name=\"templateId\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\"><option value=\"template-agency-standard\">Digital Agency - Standard<!-- --> - <!-- -->Digital Marketing</option><option value=\"template-saas-technical\">SaaS - Technical Integration<!-- --> - <!-- -->SaaS/Technology</option><option value=\"template-ecommerce-growth\">E-commerce - Growth &amp; Conversion<!-- --> - <!-- -->E-commerce</option></select></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label for=\"clientName\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Client Name</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"clientName\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" name=\"clientName\"/></div><div><label for=\"clientCompany\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Client Company</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"clientCompany\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" name=\"clientCompany\"/></div></div><div><label for=\"industry\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Industry</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"industry\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" name=\"industry\"/></div><div><label for=\"painPoints\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Pain Points (one per line)</label><textarea id=\"painPoints\" name=\"painPoints\" rows=\"4\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"- Low conversion rate on landing page - High cart abandonment - Poor mobile experience\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"goals\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Goals (one per line)</label><textarea id=\"goals\" name=\"goals\" rows=\"3\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"- Increase conversion by 50% - Reduce cart abandonment to &lt;60% - Launch mobile app\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"solutionDescription\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Solution Description</label><textarea id=\"solutionDescription\" name=\"solutionDescription\" rows=\"3\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\"></textarea></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label for=\"timeline\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Timeline</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"timeline\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"8 weeks\" name=\"timeline\"/></div><div><label for=\"investment\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Investment Range</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"investment\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"$10,000 - $15,000\" name=\"investment\"/></div></div><div><label for=\"deliverables\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Deliverables (one per line)</label><textarea id=\"deliverables\" name=\"deliverables\" rows=\"4\" required=\"\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"- Landing page redesign - A/B testing setup - Analytics dashboard\"></textarea></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label for=\"tone\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Tone</label><select id=\"tone\" name=\"tone\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\"><option value=\"professional\">Professional</option><option value=\"friendly\">Friendly</option><option value=\"technical\">Technical</option></select></div><div><label for=\"length\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Length</label><select id=\"length\" name=\"length\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\"><option value=\"short\">Short (1500-2000 words)</option><option value=\"medium\" selected=\"\">Medium (2500-3000 words)</option><option value=\"long\">Long (3500-4000 words)</option></select></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 border border-transparent rounded-lg shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-white bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-primary disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined mr-2\">auto_awesome</span>Generate Proposal with AI</button></form></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Preview</h2><div class=\"text-center py-12 text-gray-500\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-2\">description</span><p>Fill in the form and click &quot;Generate Proposal&quot; to see a preview</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-bfa919dc51912f2b.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[4845,[\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-20992096cea73e0d.js\\\"],\\\"AuthProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[1959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n6:I[947,[\\\"4879\\\",\\\"static/chu